{"words": [{"text": "أَمْ", "translation": "Or"}, {"text": "تَقُولُونَ", "translation": "(do) you say"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ", "translation": "Ibrahim"}, {"text": "وَإِسْمَـٰعِيلَ", "translation": "and Ishmael"}, {"text": "وَإِسْحَـٰقَ", "translation": "and Isaac"}, {"text": "وَيَعْقُوبَ", "translation": "and Yaqub"}, {"text": "وَٱلْأَسْبَاطَ", "translation": "and the descendants"}, {"text": "كَانُوا۟", "translation": "were"}, {"text": "هُودًا", "translation": "Jews"}, {"text": "أَوْ", "translation": "or"}, {"text": "نَصَـٰرَىٰ ۗ", "translation": "Christians"}, {"text": "قُلْ", "translation": "Say"}, {"text": "ءَأَنتُمْ", "translation": "Are you"}, {"text": "أَعْلَمُ", "translation": "better knowing"}, {"text": "أَمِ", "translation": "or"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ ۗ", "translation": "(is) Allah"}, {"text": "وَمَنْ", "translation": "And who"}, {"text": "أَظْلَمُ", "translation": "(is) more unjust"}, {"text": "مِمَّن", "translation": "than (the one) who"}, {"text": "كَتَمَ", "translation": "concealed"}, {"text": "شَهَـٰدَةً", "translation": "a testimony"}, {"text": "عِندَهُۥ", "translation": "(that) he has"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ ۗ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "(is) Allah"}, {"text": "بِغَـٰفِلٍ", "translation": "unaware"}, {"text": "عَمَّا", "translation": "of what"}, {"text": "تَعْمَلُونَ", "translation": "you do"}], "sahih": "Or do you say that Abraham and Ishmael and Isaac and Jacob and the Descendants were Jews or Christians? Say, \"Are you more knowing or is Allāh?\" And who is more unjust than one who conceals a testimony1 he has from Allāh? And Allāh is not unaware of what you do."}